<import src="../../templates/rows.wxml"/><view class="app theme-{{theme}}"><view class="wrap"><view class="intro"><view class="h1">米其林全球名录</view><view class="sub">全球 50 多个国家和地区、约 2 万家米其林餐厅：三星、二星、一星、必比登推介和入选餐厅。可按大洲、国家、城市筛选，在地图上找附近的店，也能把筛选结果发给朋友。</view><view class="toplinks"><text bindtap="about">等级怎么分、怎么评？</text><text bindtap="feedback">纠错与反馈</text></view></view><view class="controls"><view class="searchrow"><input class="q" placeholder="搜店名、城市或菜系，如：新荣记、东京" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="search"/><view class="filter-btn" bindtap="toggleSheet">筛选</view></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="levels"><view class="row nowrap"><view wx:for="{{levelNames}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{level===(index===0?'all':index-1+'')?'selected':''}}" data-value="{{index===0?'all':index-1+''}}" bindtap="selectLevel">{{item}}</view></view></scroll-view></view><view class="scope">{{scope}}　共 {{total}} 家</view><view class="search-note" wx:if="{{fuzzy}}">已为你显示相近的拼写结果</view><view class="stats"><view class="h3" bindtap="toggleStats">{{statsOpen?'▾':'▸'}} {{countryIndex?'各城市统计':continent?'各国家和地区统计':'各大洲统计'}}</view><scroll-view scroll-x wx:if="{{statsOpen}}"><view class="stats-table"><view class="stat-row head"><text>地区</text><text>三星</text><text>二星</text><text>一星</text><text>必比登</text><text>入选</text><text>合计</text></view><view class="stat-row" wx:for="{{stats}}" wx:key="name"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text wx:for="{{item.counts}}" wx:key="index">{{item}}</text><text>{{item.total}}</text></view></view></scroll-view></view><template is="rows" data="{{groups}}"/><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!total}}">没有找到符合条件的餐厅</view><view class="pager" wx:if="{{items.length<total}}"><view class="btn" bindtap="more">再显示 200 家</view></view><view class="footer">餐厅资料来自米其林指南公开数据。中文名与参考译名以原网站为准。本站与米其林、黑珍珠官方无关。</view></view><view class="shade" wx:if="{{sheet}}" bindtap="toggleSheet"/><view class="sheet" wx:if="{{sheet}}"><view class="sheethead"><text class="bold">筛选</text><text class="linkbtn" bindtap="clear">清除全部</text></view><view class="lbl">地区</view><view class="row"><view class="chip {{continent===(index?item:'')?'cont-selected':''}}" wx:for="{{continents}}" wx:key="*this" data-value="{{index?item:''}}" bindtap="selectContinent">{{item}}</view></view><view class="row pickers"><picker range="{{countries}}" value="{{countryIndex}}" data-field="countryIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="chip">{{countries[countryIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><picker range="{{cities}}" value="{{cityIndex}}" data-field="cityIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="chip">{{cities[cityIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="city-name-note">生僻地名采用参考音译，支持中文与原名检索。</view><view class="lbl">菜系与价位</view><view class="row pickers"><picker range="{{cuisines}}" value="{{cuisineIndex}}" data-field="cuisineIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="chip">{{cuisines[cuisineIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><picker range="{{priceNames}}" value="{{priceIndex}}" data-field="priceIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="chip">{{priceNames[priceIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="lbl">标签</view><view class="row"><view class="chip {{newOnly?'selected':''}}" data-flag="newOnly" bindtap="flag">本版新上榜</view><view class="chip {{upOnly?'selected':''}}" data-flag="upOnly" bindtap="flag">今年升级</view><view class="chip {{green?'selected':''}}" data-flag="green" bindtap="flag">绿星</view><view class="chip {{pearl?'selected':''}}" data-flag="pearl" bindtap="flag">也上了黑珍珠</view></view><view class="sheetfoot"><view class="btn primary" bindtap="toggleSheet">查看 {{total}} 家结果</view></view></view></view>